1
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:46,000
Living Out Loud is a comedy, drama, romance film
directed by Richard LaGravenese.

2
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Judith Moore is suddenly single after discovering her husband of fifteen years, a
successful doctor, has been having an affair with a younger woman.

3
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Judith stews, plans, plots and fantasizes, but she can't decide what to do with her life until she goes
out to a night club to see singer Liz Bailey, who is full of advice on life and love.

4
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:46,000
While out on the town, Judith is suddenly kissed by a total
stranger, which opens her eyes to new possibilities...

5
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
which is when she notices Pat, the elevator operator in her building.

6
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Judith Moore, played by Holly Hunter.

7
00:46:40,000 --> 00:46:46,000
Pat Francato, played by Danny DeVito.

8
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:26,000
Liz Bailey, played by Queen Latifah.

9
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Robert Nelson, played by Martin Donovan.

10
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
