12
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
Living Out Loud is a 1998 American comedy-drama film written and directed by Richard LaGravenese and set in New
York City, starring Holly Hunter, Danny DeVito, Queen Latifah, Martin Donovan, and Elias Koteas.

13
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
The film explores themes of infidelity, loss of loved one,
massage, female protagonist, relationship.

14
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
